# Trusted GPG Keys for codefresh-io/cli Homebrew Tap
#
# This file contains the fingerprints of GPG keys authorized to sign
# commits and releases for this tap.
#
# Format: FINGERPRINT  Name <email>
#
# To add a new key:
# 1. Generate or identify the GPG key to be used
# 2. Get the fingerprint: gpg --fingerprint KEY_ID
# 3. Add a line below with the full fingerprint and identity
# 4. Optionally export the public key to this repository
#
# For bot accounts that update formulas:
# - codefresh-git-integration[bot] <151943927+codefresh-git-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
# - cf-ci-bot-v2 <107364971+cf-ci-bot-v2@users.noreply.github.com>
#
# Maintainers: Add your GPG key fingerprints below
# Example:
# ABCD1234EFGH5678IJKL9012MNOP3456QRST7890  John Doe <john.doe@codefresh.io>

# Bot accounts - keys to be added once GPG signing is configured
# [Pending] codefresh-git-integration[bot]
# [Pending] cf-ci-bot-v2

# Human maintainers - add your keys here
